<TEXT>DEATH NOTE
MESQUITE HOLLOW HOSPICE                      
PT: ROURKE, DELMAR IGNATIUS   MRN 0094-2285   DOB 06/09/2010   AGE 66
DATE OF DEATH: 11/14/2076   TIME 03:40   ROOM 4
ADMITTED 10/17/2076 FOR END STAGE RENAL DISEASE; ALSO PROSTATE CANCER.
PRONOUNCED BY: DR REUBEN CASTELLANOS.  NOTIFIED: DAUGHTER MARISELA, EX WIFE CARLOTTA ROURKE. SON DILLON CALLED BACK ON THE DAY AND CAME TOO LATE.
CAUSE OF DEATH: ESRD. NO AUTOPSY. BODY TO DESERT ROSE FUNERAL HOME.

FAMILY DRAFT OF OBITUARY (PASTED BY SW, NOT FOR CHART?):
"DELMAR 'DEL' ROURKE, 66, OF TUCSON, PASSED PEACEFULLY ON NOVEMBER 14TH. OWNER OF ROURKE &amp; SONS PLUMBING FOR 30 YEARS. SURVIVED BY HIS DAUGHTER MARISELA AND HER HUSBAND HIEU, SON DELLMAR JR, BROTHER IGNATIUS. SERVICE SATURDAY NOVEMBER 21ST 11 AM AT DESERT ROSE FUNERAL HOME, 2210 E BROADWAY BLVD. THE PLUMBING BUSINESS WAS NAMED FOR HIS BOYS."
[SW COMMENT: SON'S NAME IS DILLON NOT DELLMAR JR - TELL FAMILY]
R CASTELLANOS MD   E-SIGNED 11/14/2076
</TEXT>
